---
title: MF-03 · Asynchronous AI scoring
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Mf03ScoringDispatcher
  participant AI as AI Matching Service v2
  participant LLM as Google Gemini
  participant API as AiIntegration endpoints
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor HR as Internal HR
  W->>DB: Load PENDING AiMatchResult → PROCESSING
  W->>AI: POST /score (CV file, JD, requirements)
  AI->>AI: Extract text, Sentence-BERT similarity
  AI->>LLM: Assess each MUST/SHOULD requirement with evidence
  LLM-->>AI: JSON assessment
  AI->>AI: Verify quotes exist in CV, score 0–100 and tier
  AI->>API: POST /internal/ai-results (callback)
  alt success
  API->>DB: AiMatchResult COMPLETED: score, tier, per-requirement results
  API->>HR: Ranked list updates in real time
  else error / retries exhausted
  API->>DB: FAILED + FailureCode, HR can retry
  end
